Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:16.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's way to many...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:18.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't reach us for now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we level up by keep attaking them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:24.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But my Spirit Energy are all used up......
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like a stalemate......
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:34.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,AH!!! IT WORKED! Fireball!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It really worked! Xiaohei is the best!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems a lot easier in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:42.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, or else normal players might as well quit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright! Watch out for my--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do......
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, they are leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:53.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:55.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are players, not real wolves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:58.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must have left since they can't get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:01.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's many out there, why waste time on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think you're right, might be just be passing by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:05.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Disaster resolved just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:09.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, why are wolf play ers grouped up like this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:12.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because wolf players cannot attack their own kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:15.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Within 10 meters they share  Pool
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:18.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means, if they don't take away the pack's hp,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:20.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,won't even get you 1 kill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,THA MAKES NO SENSE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,IF THEY GANG UP ON ME, I'LL GET ONE-SHOT!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:25.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HOW DO YOU PLAY THAT! WHO DESIGNED THIS!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:26.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laojun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:31.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such interesting game design
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:36.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,THat person is mine!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:37.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dont' steal 'em from me!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Jiulao, no one is contesting you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.19,Main Dialogue,,0,1000,0,,Yay you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.19,Main Dialogue,,770,0,0,,Well done !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:16.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Powerful! We leveld up twice again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whew.......
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:20.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We seem to be getting used to it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:27.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing......
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:29.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I get used to attack form,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me to be the party healer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:33.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:36.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My fireball got bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:38.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're improving quite quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:41.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The map says there's a city behind the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, let's go then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:47.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa~~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So huge! Seems to be an entirely different style from the last city
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:54.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:56.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are clothing requirements?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:02.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go! Into the City!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:04.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's too many people in there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are not a part of this faction, everyone is an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before reaching our strong points, best not to approach players hotspots
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way we can hold Xiaohe's advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:16.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:53.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Time's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,  logging off then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Augh~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:03.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's there such an enjoyable game? Way too immersive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,......no way right......
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is......going on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me to answer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young man~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,MONSTER!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:38.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?! Where are your manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creation Class
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inner Spirit Class
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:23.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Living Spirit Class
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:28.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These skills created reflective "illusions" to make him unapproachable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:29.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very interesting ideas
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:34.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In real life, Elfins rarely uses this many classes of skills to specialize 1 kind of ability
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the game offered this possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:36.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:41.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But seems like they are still taken care of, haha
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are not yet proficient
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:45.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsk gaudy tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Expected more from a "Human Powerhouse"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:50.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've been in contact with Spiritual Power for just a few days thus far
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that there's a human that can best me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,YOU DON"T COUNT! YOU'RE A MONSTER!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:57.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HMPH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this game will reintroduce humans to Elfins
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:06.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and to reintroduce Elfins to humans
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:13.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't imagine that the Guild's most crowded mission was part of a game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:20.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like we are level 40
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:21.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things are going smoothly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look at our completion rate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:25.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Ah......
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like the only thing we've completed are the levels
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:28.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every other part of the quest is empty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:30.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does Level 40 not offer any Abilty Upgrades
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, nope
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:36.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So far the only organized abilities are Level Sight, Self Heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Info, Polymorph, Flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and "Spirit Realm" at Lv 150
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone have reached it before, but died soon after
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:45.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't really research its uses year
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:48.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So far no one else have reached this level, so it's uncertain what lies beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:51.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can stil lget killed after Level 150?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, High level deaths are something that intrigues everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are threads here that have organized it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:58.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,called List of the Fallen, and recorded the cause of dead of those who've reached Top 100
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:06.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some are unknown, some are "glitched" to death, some AFKed that got "pierced"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's also those "stacked" by stones, and those wo were poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Stacked" to death by stones? What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:16.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was someon who was over Lv 100, his log-off spot got found out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:20.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When he was offline, about 30 people occupied his respawn point with a mountain of stone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He died the instat he logged on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do that??
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:27.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why everyone's logging off now in safe zons, or else quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he died like that ,who gets the exp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dunno, didn't seem like someone kept the xp
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:35.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how this level 150 player die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:38.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh......he was stung by scorpion, couldn't handle the poison
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything's so dangerous......
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:45.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the scorpoin player that stung him to death gained many levels
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now it's at level 96
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it stungs us, we'd likely die as well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:50.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa......
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:54.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of skill is Spirit Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every creature have a Spirit Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:59.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but as a skill, it likely wouldn't jsut be obtaining a Spirit Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should be usable to some degree in terms of utility
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:02.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:06.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many players already gave up on playing for levels ups
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some are obsessed withthe customization sliders in the starrt of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some began collecting the world's resources
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some started shops and businesses in cities
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and formed a series of shopping districts and towns
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:21.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though there are no system restrictions, the players agreed on a Peace-Zone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Becoming more lik a realistic world
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:25.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as well as people randomly experiencing different lives
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:27.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if they become abird, they will fly freely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:29.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if they become a fish, they'll swim freely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll just try again if they die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna do that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:36.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we complete the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:37.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,let's try a different playstyle as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course! Hahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:43.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we can start to slowly complete side quests
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we run into any enemies in the process, might as well level ourselves up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:47.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:55.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be late!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:09.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:29.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Caught one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fish are players too, why would they take the bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:35.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe the've got quests to steal food from the hook
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just like fishing, testing both party's patiance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,......Mm, confirm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:48.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quest complete
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:52.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did big bro happen to become an NPC?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't help it, not really a great combatant
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can only take quests like these to level up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:58.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at it like working for the system
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa~~you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do we take quests like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the very bottom of the quest lists is your system menu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:33.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got 4 seconds! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap, he's gona break the house again......
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:53.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elfin could create a world this large for the sake of a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:55.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't there be many world like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for a Spirit Realm to be this massive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,everything in here, must be incredible tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa...like a shrinked model?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:07.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what form are we taking currently?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:11.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our physical bodies should be dormant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our consciousness likely going through machines
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:16.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Controlling this body made through Creation class powers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big bro knows so much
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haha, I've had a similar experience
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afer our Strength, Reflex and SPeed was strenghtened
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:25.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every time logging off makes the body feel heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:28.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel a lot more normal on the other hand
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:30.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what it feels like to be an Elfin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We found a new quest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:47.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:50.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Climb Mt. Panlilas"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems easy enough, can't get tired in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:55.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's right in front of us on the map
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:01.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa......
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you climb that......
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No worries
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:16.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here with ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:54.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop the fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's all stop fighting......
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:01.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said stop already! Didn't you hear me!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that someone's safety alarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:08.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like your alarm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:09.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.71,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,An unknown intruder has entered the room
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.47,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,The action has been assesed as crime
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:27.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wha-wha-wha- What should I do??
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.22,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Recording evidence of crime
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:28.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look over here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:31.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? It even has this type ability?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:32.43,Text C,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.5\pos(668,316)}Would you wish to stun {\c&FFF9E5&}----{\c}\Nthe assailent?{\c&FFF9E5&}-----------------{\c}\N
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:32.02,Text C,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.5\fs50\pos(726,472)}*Safe and harmless electrical current
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:40.32,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,You have entered 'God mode', Please logout as soon as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to head out now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:42.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No worries
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:43.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friend me! We can continue later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna take my leave now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is even higher up than we imagined, no wonder so few people finished it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? We can see the number of completions?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:07.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yop, you have to click here. Currently there are 8 people
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woah, that is actually so little
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't there a lot of bird type players?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:13.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't they just fly there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:16.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say the height is above the maximum height for bird-flight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There seems to be no temperature decrease due to height in-game
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Normally, it should be frigid at the top of such a mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:25.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this mountain the tallest in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Possibly, since there is only one mountain-climbing mission
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only the tallest mountain could match the mission's difficulty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you recovered your energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:39.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup! All better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:41.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's continue
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:44.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We climbed another 500m
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many jumps are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe three more jumps like this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really wnat to know the abilities possesed by those who reached the summit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm......We'll know soon enough
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,10 people have reached the top
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Therefore, two people just got there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will we be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:22.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We actually did it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:27.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would I lie to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah...... We fainally arrived.......
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:40.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:44.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is so beautiful!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can see so many cities from here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you can't even see the horizon, this world is ginormous
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:53.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really wanna jump from here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't relax just yet, someone is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:05.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Level 40? They can reach here with only level 40?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Level 23?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,hey little fellas! Are you all elfins too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:11.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, elder
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha, good, we finally meet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice type, fire type, dimensional type...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...what messed-up type are you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:27.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mission objective is over there, go quickly now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:29.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you elder
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woah! So much experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you guys leveled up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:41.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then come down, let us spar
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:43.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't go easy on you~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elder, we are hee only for the mission
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well this is not up to you, I joined this game just to find opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys stand aside
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahaha, little kid you are going to face me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:02.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just a game
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:16.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why run
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:48.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:50.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he much stronger than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hard to say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:53.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they're only lv 23, so we don't have much to gain even if we win
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:55.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just gained 5 levels, and they gained the same experience
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means they reached the summit at around level 10
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:03.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:10.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shifu, are we not chasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chase what, I can't win if we get into a real fight
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:16.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is time for us to leave also
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the next mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The closest one is "Stride"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:22.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:24.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does this really count as training?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, this is so fun~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:34.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like they've left
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:35.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahaha, So thrilling
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is danger around every corner in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To others, we are also dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:44.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are so many strong individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:48.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we leveled up, the system gave us a new mission
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:53.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The level 45 threshold? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our experience has gone beyong level 45
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to complete this task to continue leveling up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:01.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:04.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it doesn't appear too difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:06.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have two chances to be warped to a random location within 10km of the target
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How close are we to our target?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:11.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:13.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,100km
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:17.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just warp there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our gametime today is just about done
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we get warped far from the target, we can continue tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let us be off
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:34.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you people!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad, a high level team
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:41.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are merely passing by, we'll leave right away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:45.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A blue warping skill! Thta's exclusive to the assatination mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:46.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are here to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:47.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The warp is random, our mission isn't here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The designated target is within 10m
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The warp is too close!! Why answer me!! The system is doing it on purpose!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:20:59.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:32.62,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:37.36,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:42.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:48.26,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:54.41,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:59.21,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:03.89,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:10.41,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:21.73,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:27.15,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:32.19,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.19,0:22:43.42,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:48.97,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:55.81,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
